**Describe the bug**
The list of current Global and GlobalCommunity admins are not displayed on the client.

**To Reproduce**
Steps to reproduce the behavior:

1. Go to https://acc.alkem.io/admin/authorization/GlobalAdmin
2. There are no members under assigned column
![image.png](https://images.zenhubusercontent.com/5f5ff9fd50a1a94a1f25f32c/7645c4a2-a6ad-4b2e-9f47-19abd2948ade)
3. Navigate to https://acc.alkem.io/graphql
4. Perform the following query:
```
  usersWithAuthorizationCredential(credentialsCriteriaData: $credentialsCriteriaData) {
    displayName,
    id,
    agent {
      credentials {
      	id,
      	resourceID
      	type
